        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to Jeremiah a second time, while he was still shut up in the court of the guard: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " who made the earth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " who formed it to establish it—the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is his name: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Call to me and I will answer you, and will tell you great and hidden things which you have not known. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, concerning the houses of this city and the houses of the kings of Judah which were torn down to make a defense against the siege mounds and before the sword:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb obscure",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Chaldeans are coming in to fight",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "They are coming in to fight against the Chaldeans",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and to fill them with the dead bodies of men whom I shall smite in my anger and my wrath, for I have hidden my face from this city because of all their wickedness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I will bring to it health and healing, and I will heal them and reveal to them abundance",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb uncertain",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of prosperity and security. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will restore the fortunes of Judah and the fortunes of Israel, and rebuild them as they were at first. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will cleanse them from all the guilt of their sin against me, and I will forgive all the guilt of their sin and rebellion against me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this city",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and it",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be to me a name of joy, a praise and a glory before all the nations of the earth who shall hear of all the good that I do for them; they shall fear and tremble because of all the good and all the prosperity I provide for it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
