                "loc": "ZEC.6.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In those days and at that time I will cause a righteous Branch to spring forth for David; and he shall execute justice and righteousness in the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days Judah will be saved and Jerusalem will dwell securely. And this is the name by which it will be called: ‘The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is our righteousness.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
