          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to Jeremiah: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": If you can break my covenant with the day and my covenant with the night, so that day and night will not come at their appointed time, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then also my covenant with David my servant may be broken, so that he shall not have a son to reign on his throne, and my covenant with the Levitical priests my ministers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the host of heaven cannot be numbered and the sands of the sea cannot be measured, so I will multiply the descendants of David my servant, and the Levitical priests who minister to me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
